# The monitor's memory. Ignored by default because it records WHAT IS BEING WATCHED, and
# on a public repository that publishes a holder's positions. Commit it deliberately if the
# change history is wanted in git; it is plain JSON and diffs readably.
data/monitor-ledger.json
# Same reasoning as the ledger: it records which opportunities have been put in
# front of you and which you acted on, and this repository is public.
data/seen-register.json

